#VLSM addressing plan
## Design Rationale

VLSM was used because each department has a different number of required hosts.
The largest network was allocated first to prevent adress fragmentation.
Guest users were assigned a /25 because the department requires approximately 100 hosts and a /25 provides 126 usable addresses.
Sales was assigned a /26, providing 62 usable addresses.
Engineering was assigned a /27, providing 30 usable addresses.
The remaining address space was intentionally left unallocated to allow for future expansion.

Guest --> 100 hosts
Sales --> 50 hosts
Engineering --> 25 hosts

